WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Click the magnifying glass to open Find in Files.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
2. Type Trail Notes to search the project.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
3. Results group matching lines by filename.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
4. Click a matching line once to preview its code.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
5. Double-click the same line to open its file.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
6. Close Search Results to see about.html at line 21.
